<h2>Requirement description</h2>

<p>
This requirement is concerned with ensuring that teams make use of existing NHS England shared capabilities rather than creating duplicate solutions.
</p>

<p>
The objective is to increase consistency, reduce duplication, improve interoperability and maximise value from existing investments. Where an approved shared capability exists for a particular need, teams should normally adopt it unless there is a justified reason not to do so.
</p>

<p>
If a shared service is not used, the rationale, risks and alternative approach should be clearly documented and understood.
</p>

<p>
<strong>In simple terms:</strong><br>
Use established NHS England shared services wherever they meet the need, and be able to justify any exceptions.
</p>

